"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage05.png", "id": "2214028069052374", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_2214028072385707_966198005100103568_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NoHSqKrbGpkQ7kNvwFbLsC6&_nc_oc=AdpusyqMScFUyxy3_K6L60PXkRgc7rU7w8TO0Bm0P6c7mIQSjTF9nkAhrD-ZFssDHPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQmt4x_7IIagii3nbliKxMOfb-ajVJCtXlHytlqApn4Uw&oe=6B0DBCFC"}, {"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage03.png", "id": "1315333866150469", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982517_1315333869483802_8451455932263526366_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zVlA7KQ7rB0Q7kNvwGK98MG&_nc_oc=AdpgtSSaZBEYz8V5iqhfxZZq2WknOWFoLcCvcjKZ-6GPTjocd-9lCu6fBVDH8AT0dWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQEWPXggU4SUyzfRzJOPvoBUvUeI7n8la-Q4S7jL40Xtw&oe=6B0D995A"}, {"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage02.png", "id": "600762692399494", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974856_600762695732827_6505960866598570138_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ch0oycGR0KkQ7kNvwHtOHMw&_nc_oc=AdpL943lwO6KrsRDLOAkSpwunjJD3a9GgA3GzJqIhbZlphMvZYxqgR7deRT-WtVQ5_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT6Ih-DbKN1EVAOQCg9Lfa15Hgak1HMOwwlnFha6pPPDQ&oe=6B0DA051"}, {"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage01.png", "id": "2063620994075579", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210888_2063620997408912_6888476953228441268_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c7bRlnQP0JQQ7kNvwHByuJm&_nc_oc=AdpfPh-5ldPT_p9Vo8QumDrdit43ujY0sjgIzxNlSnPdr8xM7mnKzk_yVynJ5k2bEqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSAJitMS2daAL839rebweWjPqLTP1Q_lweGhSQZ7x6X3w&oe=6B0DBA66"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Eclipse Defense", "keywords": ["space", "defense", "spaceship", "gravity"], "long_description": "A Hero\u2019s Call in Space \u2013 The Ultimate VR Experience at Eclipse Defense\n\nIn this thrilling VR game, you are a skilled space worker tasked with saving the world from destruction. As your spaceship docks with a massive space station, chaos unfolds. Meteors are hurtling toward Earth, and only you can stop them!\n\nKey Features:\n Immersive Space Exploration: Experience realistic docking mechanics as you pilot and connect your spaceship to the station.\n Interactive Environment: Explore the detailed interiors of the space station, complete with tools, ladders, and control systems.\n Intense Meteor Defense: Climb to the upper levels, activate the shooter cannon, and unleash firepower to destroy waves of meteors.\n Dynamic Challenges: Repair systems, manage alerts, and face emergencies while defending the station.\n Stunning Visuals: A breathtaking sci-fi environment with dynamic lighting, realistic damage effects, and vast space backdrops.\n\nThe world depends on you! Grab your tools, man the cannons, and fight to protect Earth in this heart-pounding VR space adventure.", "short_description": "Dock, Defend, and Save the World!\nStep into the boots of a space worker in this immersive VR experience. Dock your spaceship at the station, take control of powerful shooter cannons, and defend Earth from an onslaught of meteors threatening humanity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.chef.gs/eclipse-defense-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.chef.gs/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "CHEF Game Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.chef.gs/contact", "website_url": "https://www.chef.gs/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "externa